#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-stock.php
msgid "Warehouse of companies and professionals: every steel item they own, published on the market or kept in stock only (new and reused), with a reference and a location for each variant, quantity corrections, the history of movements (sales accepted on the platform are taken off automatically), prices changed for a whole type, printable labels with a QR code, and limits per plan. Requires SM Core and SM Products."
msgstr ""

